{"sha": "d5abf0181df45b8d63b7e87fc32799d20ca09d1805a7e9c8c8fa2a9c6d80ab1b", "body": ["\\begin{solution}{pb:b2:integration:1}", "\\textbf{1.} 在 $0^+$ 处被积函数 $\\sim t^{x-1}$，有限端点处的", "比较积分收敛当且仅当 $1 - x < 1$，即 $x > 0$", "（而 $x \\leq 0$ 时 $t^{x-1} \\geq t^{-1}$，发散）；在", "$+\\infty$ 处，$t^{x-1}\\eu^{-t} = o(t^{-2})$ 对一切", "$x$ 都收敛。于是 $\\Gamma(x) = \\frac{\\Gamma(x+1)}{x}$，且 $\\Gamma(x+1)", "\\to \\Gamma(1) = 1$，当 $x \\to 0^+$ 时（由连续性，", "\\cref{thm:b2:integration:gammaprops}）：$\\Gamma(x) \\sim", "\\frac1x$。", "", "\\textbf{2.} 令 $t = u^2$，$\\dd t = 2u\\,\\dd u$：", "\\[", "\\Gamma\\Bigl(\\frac12\\Bigr) = \\int_0^\\infty", "t^{-1/2}\\eu^{-t}\\dd t", "= \\int_0^\\infty \\frac{\\eu^{-u^2}}{u}\\,2u\\,\\dd u", "= 2\\int_0^\\infty \\eu^{-u^2}\\dd u = \\sqrt\\pi", "\\]", "由\\cref{exo:b2:integration:8}，令 $u = v/\\sqrt2$：", "\\[", "\\int_\\R \\eu^{-v^2/2}\\dd v", "= 2\\sqrt2\\int_0^\\infty \\eu^{-u^2}\\dd u", "= \\sqrt2\\,\\sqrt\\pi = \\sqrt{2\\pi} .", "\\]", "", "\\textbf{3.} $n = 0$ 时成立（两边均为 $\\sqrt\\pi$）。若", "$\\Gamma(n + \\frac12) = \\frac{(2n)!}{4^n n!}\\sqrt\\pi$，则由", "函数方程得", "\\[", "\\Gamma\\Bigl(n + 1 + \\frac12\\Bigr)", "= \\Bigl(n + \\frac12\\Bigr)\\Gamma\\Bigl(n + \\frac12\\Bigr)", "= \\frac{2n+1}{2}\\cdot\\frac{(2n)!}{4^n n!}\\sqrt\\pi", "= \\frac{(2n+2)!}{4^{n+1}(n+1)!}\\sqrt\\pi ,", "\\]", "最后一步利用 $\\frac{(2n+2)!}{(2n)!} = (2n+2)(2n+1)$", "和 $\\frac{2n+1}{2} = \\frac{(2n+2)(2n+1)}{4(n+1)}$。", "", "\\textbf{4.} 由\\cref{thm:b2:integration:gammaprops}可得", "$\\Gamma''(x) = \\int_0^\\infty t^{x-1}\\eu^{-t}(\\ln t)^2\\dd t$", "（两次应用莱布尼茨法则，控制方式与", "定理证明中相同）；被积函数 $\\geq 0$ 且不恒为", "零，故 $\\Gamma'' > 0$：$\\Gamma$ 严格凸，", "$\\Gamma'$ 严格递增。由 $\\Gamma(1) = \\Gamma(2)", "= 1$，由罗尔定理得 $x_0 \\in \\intoo12$，使 $\\Gamma'(x_0) =", "0$；由 $\\Gamma'$ 严格单调，$x_0$ 为其唯一", "零点，且 $\\Gamma' < 0$ 于其前、$\\Gamma' > 0$ 于其后：", "$\\Gamma$ 在 $\\intoo0{x_0}$ 上递减，在", "$\\intoo{x_0}\\infty$ 上递增，且 $x_0$ 是唯一的最小值点。", "", "\\textbf{5.} 设 $k \\in \\N$，$x \\geq 3$；取整数", "$n$ 满足 $n + 1 \\leq x < n + 2$（从而 $n \\geq 1$）。由", "第 4 题的单调性（自 $x_0 < 2$ 起成立）：$\\Gamma(x)", "\\geq \\Gamma(n + 1) = n!$，而 $x^k \\leq (n+2)^k$。由于", "$\\frac{n!}{(n+2)^k} \\to \\infty$（阶乘增长快于幂，参见", "本科一年级分册），故 $\\frac{\\Gamma(x)}{x^k} \\geq \\frac{n!}{(n+2)^k} \\to", "\\infty$，当 $x \\to \\infty$ 时，即 $x^k = o(\\Gamma(x))$。", "", "\\textbf{6.} 在 $0$ 附近被积函数 $\\sim t^{x-1}$", "（当且仅当 $x > 0$ 时收敛），在 $1$ 附近它为 $\\sim (1-t)^{y-1}$", "（当且仅当 $y > 0$）；两个比较都是正函数之间的比较，", "故 $B(x,y)$ 恰在 $x, y > 0$ 时收敛。作代换", "$t \\mapsto 1 - t$ 交换两个因子，故 $B(x,y) = B(y,x)$。", "", "\\textbf{7.} $B(x,1) = \\int_0^1 t^{x-1}\\dd t = \\frac1x$。在", "$\\intcc\\varepsilon{1-\\varepsilon}$ 上分部积分，取 $u = (1-t)^y$，$v =", "\\frac{t^x}{x}$：", "\\[", "\\int t^{x-1}(1-t)^{y}\\dd t", "= \\Bigl[\\frac{t^x(1-t)^y}{x}\\Bigr]", "+ \\frac{y}{x}\\int t^{x}(1-t)^{y-1}\\dd t ;", "\\]", "方括号在 $\\varepsilon \\to 0$ 时两端均为零（$x >", "0$ 在 $0$ 处，$y > 0$ 在 $1$ 处），于是 $B(x, y+1) = \\frac", "yx\\,B(x+1, y)$。", "", "\\textbf{8.} 由 $t + (1-t) = 1$：", "\\[", "t^{x-1}(1-t)^{y-1} = t^{x}(1-t)^{y-1} + t^{x-1}(1-t)^{y},", "\\]", "于是 $B(x,y) = B(x+1,y) + B(x,y+1)$。第 7 题给出 $B(x+1,y) =", "\\frac xy B(x,y+1)$，代入得", "\\[", "B(x,y) = \\Bigl(\\frac xy + 1\\Bigr)B(x,y+1)", "= \\frac{x+y}{y}\\,B(x,y+1),", "\\]", "即 $B(x,y+1) = \\frac{y}{x+y}B(x,y)$；另一关系式", "由第 6 题的对称性得出。", "", "\\textbf{9.} 对 $n$ 归纳（$m$ 固定）：$B(m,1) = \\frac1m =", "\\frac{(m-1)!\\,0!}{m!}$，若公式对 $n$ 成立，", "\\[", "B(m, n+1) = \\frac{n}{m+n}\\,B(m,n)", "= \\frac{n}{m+n}\\cdot\\frac{(m-1)!(n-1)!}{(m+n-1)!}", "= \\frac{(m-1)!\\,n!}{(m+n)!} .", "\\]", "改写得 $B(m,n) = \\frac{(m-1)!(n-1)!}{(m+n-1)!} =", "\\bigl[(m+n-1)\\binom{m+n-2}{m-1}\\bigr]^{-1}$。", "", "\\textbf{10.} 等式 $B(x,n) =", "\\frac{\\Gamma(x)\\Gamma(n)}{\\Gamma(x+n)}$ 两端均等于 $\\frac1x$（当 $n =", "1$ 时，$\\Gamma(1) = 1$，$\\Gamma(x+1) = x\\Gamma(x)$）。若两者在", "$n$ 处相等，由递降关系与", "函数方程得：", "\\[", "B(x, n+1) = \\frac{n}{x+n}\\,B(x,n), \\qquad", "\\frac{\\Gamma(x)\\Gamma(n+1)}{\\Gamma(x+n+1)}", "= \\frac{n}{x+n}\\cdot", "\\frac{\\Gamma(x)\\Gamma(n)}{\\Gamma(x+n)} :", "\\]", "两数列满足相同的递推关系，且初值相同，", "故对所有 $n \\in \\N^*$ 及 $x > 0$ 二者相等。", ""]}